KNOWNBUG
type_parameter_port8.sv
--bound 0
^\[main\.assert\.1\] always main\.egress == main\.ingress: PROVED up to bound 0$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The override value of a type parameter port is resolved in the scope of
the instantiated module instead of the instantiating module, giving
"cyclic dependency when elaborating main.dut.data_t".
Reported in https://github.com/diffblue/hw-cbmc/issues/2130.
